#~ msgid "**Affinity Groups**"
#~ msgstr "**Affinity Groups**"

#~ msgid ""
#~ "|clusters| offer affinity groups and "
#~ "anti-affinity groups. These work similarly"
#~ " to affinity groups on other "
#~ "platforms, such as the affinity rules"
#~ " concept in VMware vSphere. An "
#~ "affinity group contains a type (either"
#~ " Keep Together or Keep Separate) and"
#~ " a list of servers which should "
#~ "have the rule applied. Whenever "
#~ "possible, servers configured to \"Keep "
#~ "Together\" will run on the same "
#~ "|host|. Servers configured to \"Keep "
#~ "Separate\" will be balanced across "
#~ "|hosts| to the maximum extent possible."
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "|clusters| offer grupos de afinidad y"
#~ " anti-grupos de afinidad. Estos "
#~ "funcionar similarly a grupos de afinidad"
#~ " en otro platforms, como el affinity"
#~ " reglas concept en VMware vSphere. Un"
#~ " grupo de afinidad contiene un tipo"
#~ " (cualquiera Mantener Together o Mantener"
#~ " Separate) y un lista de servidores"
#~ " cual debería tienen el regla "
#~ "applied. Whenever possible, servidores "
#~ "configurado a \"Mantener Together\" será "
#~ "ejecutar en el mismo |host|. Servidores"
#~ " configurado a \"Mantener Separate\" será"
#~ " be balanced a través de |hosts| "
#~ "al máximo extent possible."

